### Step 1: Identify Coupling and Dependencies

Coupling refers to the degree of interdependence between software modules. High coupling can make code difficult to maintain and extend. Dependencies are the relationships between modules where one module relies on another to function properly.

#### How to Identify Coupling and Dependencies:
